(Northstar Cloud Incident Response Playbook - Page 1) Tj
T*
(SEVERITY) Tj
T*
(SEV-1: broad customer impact, revenue path affected, or data integrity risk.) Tj
T*
(SEV-2: material degradation with workaround or limited blast radius.) Tj
T*
(SEV-3: minor degradation with low customer impact.) Tj
T*
(Two independent critical signals on a TIER_1 service are sufficient to open an incident.) Tj
T*
(Never infer customer impact from CPU alone; corroborate with errors, latency, queueing, or support evidence.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
