/F1 11 Tf
50 740 Td
14 TL
(Northstar Cloud Incident Response Playbook - Page 2) Tj
T*
(CONTAINMENT AND CHANGE SAFETY) Tj
T*
(If degradation begins within 15 minutes of a deployment, evaluate rollback as a candidate action.) Tj
T*
(Rollback requires evidence that the changed service is plausibly causal.) Tj
T*
(Database failover is a HIGH_RISK action and always requires human Incident Commander approval.) Tj
T*
(Do not restart a database solely because an application service has high latency.) Tj
T*
(Prefer reversible actions before destructive or state-changing actions.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
7 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 13 0 R >> >> /Contents 8 0 R >>
