stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 740 Td
14 TL
(Northstar Cloud Incident Response Playbook - Page 3) Tj
T*
(ESCALATION) Tj
T*
(SEV-1 always requires Incident Commander escalation.) Tj
T*
(Any action touching a TIER_1 database requires platform on-call approval.) Tj
T*
(Contradictory evidence must be surfaced; do not hide it to make a recommendation look stronger.) Tj
T*
(If evidence confidence is below MEDIUM, gather more evidence before customer communication unless safety requires immediate escalation.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
9 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 13 0 R >> >> /Contents 10 0 R >>
