10 0 obj
<< /Length 490 >>
stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 740 Td
14 TL
(Northstar Cloud Incident Response Playbook - Page 4) Tj
T*
(COMMUNICATION) Tj
T*
(Customer-facing status is required for confirmed SEV-1 and SEV-2 incidents with external impact.) Tj
T*
(State observed symptoms and mitigation; do not state an unverified root cause as fact.) Tj
T*
(Strategic customers receive a direct account update after public status is approved.) Tj
T*
(Internal updates must distinguish FACT, HYPOTHESIS, ACTION, and OPEN QUESTION.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
