stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 740 Td
14 TL
(Northstar Cloud Incident Response Playbook - Page 5) Tj
T*
(RECOVERY AND CLOSURE) Tj
T*
(Recovery requires two consecutive healthy observation windows for the primary SLO.) Tj
T*
(After mitigation, continue monitoring dependent services for at least 15 minutes.) Tj
T*
(Capture timeline, evidence, decisions, rejected hypotheses, and human approvals for post-incident review.) Tj
ET
endstream
